\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Explainable AI (XAI) layer integration within the automated diagnostic pipeline, illustrating the mapping of latent feature spaces to localized spatial heatmaps for clinical validation.}}{14}{figure.caption.7}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces Centralized server architecture for federated learning, detailing the secure, iterative parameters exchange loop between the global orchestrator and localized institutional edge nodes.}}{16}{figure.caption.8}%
